LAST-MODIFIED:20250801T220125Z
UID:10003027-1779044400-1779049800@unitedarts.org
SUMMARY:We Are Phoenix
DESCRIPTION:Songs about dancing\, as well as songs set in a specific dance rhythm or style\, stretch throughout music history and across all cultures and nationalities. This program will sample a wide variety of music from the Renaissance to contemporary\, including pop music\, musical theatre\, and world music. You’ll hear pieces by Schubert\, Brahms\, Britten\, Copland\, Van Morrison\, and Abba\, as well as music from “Wicked”.
URL:https://unitedarts.org/calendar/we-are-phoenix/
LOCATION:Stewart Theater NC State University
CATEGORIES:Concert
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://unitedarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/We-Are-Phoenix-RGB-01.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="North Carolina Master Chorale":MAILTO:samantha@ncmasterchorale.org
END:VEVENT
